        "title": "Gym Packages",
        "description": "For those creating an exercise room, we have created some of the popular options for various gym options based on the number of square feet you have below.\n\nThese are sets of equipment are fully customizable and any pieces can be changed around.\n\n The below is only a starting point to determine what would fit in this size and what equipment/accessories a typical gym of this size would buy. One-exercise strength machines are inefficient, thus smaller gyms and exercise rooms need multipurpose ones.\n\nThese can give you an idea of what gyms of various size would buy and help you furnish a gym with everything you need. We can handle a 250-square-foot home gym, a 5000-square-foot commercial gym, or anything in between.",
